    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's exactly what i mean though. if my awareness is being tuned to these things, then the boundary between my thoughts and my reality is getting pretty thin. if the \"science\" can't explain why the timing is so precise, then isn't it more logical to assume there's a connection between my internal state and these external events? like, if i can predict the patterns, isn't that proof i'm tapping into a sort of synchronicity engine or something?",
